      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu Immortals in the main hall name her and Hong Xiu as Unfettered Scholar’s two Gu Immortal attendants. When he enters with a woman in a red dress, they identify that companion as Fairy Hong Xiu and say that if Fairy Tian Xiang had come, her inborn fragrance would already have filled the hall. After Unfettered Scholar became an immortal, he spent heavily to raise both attendants to Gu Immortal as well.",
